WEBVTT

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:12.460
<b>August</b>

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.250
<b>SHS</b>

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.250
<b>Satogahama
High School
Girls'
Baseball
Team</b>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.080
Thirty years ago...

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:43.890
...there wasn't a single
high school in Japan

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:46.060
with a girls' baseball team.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.400
But nowadays, thirty schools 
across Japan have one.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.500
And we're continuing that trend with this:

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.270
Our story!

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:17.700
<b>April</b>

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>Entrance
Ceremony</b>

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>Satogahama
High
School</b>

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.350
Satogahama
High School

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.350
<i>That concludes the entrance ceremony.</i>

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.630
<i>Next up is club orientation, 
presented by our returning students.</i>

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:41.890
Head!

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:43.290
Leg!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:45.660
Torso!

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.080
Hey, you know...

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:48.960
What?

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:58.850
Torso!

00:01:58.850 --> 00:01:59.820
Head!

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.260
Tsubasa?

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.410
Head!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.180
Don't tell me...

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.160
That concludes our club demos—

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:20.610
Excuse me!

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:26.580
Can I have the floor?

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:28.540
Isn't she...

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.170
What is it?

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.720
The girls' hardball baseball team
is looking for members!

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.720
<b>Seeking
Members</b>

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.720
<b>Girls' Hardball
Baseball
Team</b>

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.500
A girls'...

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.560
...baseball team?

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.990
<b>Play Ball!</b>

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:28.780
Arihara Tsubasa-san of Class 1-3.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.750
You can't just start your own club.

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.290
I'm sorry!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.090
Wait a second, Student Council President!

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:37.960
Tomocchi?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.400
I told Tsubasa that
if she wanted to start a club,

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.170
she should do something
to make it stand out.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:46.230
But what I did just now was all my idea.

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.760
No, I was the one
who planted the idea in her head...

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.390
I'm the one at fault here!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.100
You're too close.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:04:59.060
Miss Kakehashi...

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.890
I'll leave it in your hands.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:03.780
Okay.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.110
Have you chosen a club yet, Nakano?

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.560
I've always had my heart set on
joining the school newspapurr.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.820
It's time to get homeroom underway.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:20.410
Ah, the celebrity returns.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:23.090
I bet the student council gave you an earful.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.600
A girls' baseball team, was it?

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:29.480
Our school doesn't even
have a <i>boys'</i> baseball team.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.720
Isn't that because it used 
to be an all-girls school?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:32.900
Oh, yeah...

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.180
All right, take your seats.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.050
<i>That girl... is in my class.</i>

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.190
<i>A club...</i>

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.050
<i>Which one should I join?</i>

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.750
Where is it?

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.630
The club building...

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.690
Suzuki-san!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:19.140
U-Um, we went to the same 
middle school. I'm Nozaki.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.460
Oh.

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:25.220
Um... Which club are you going to join?

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.630
If you want, we could 
go over together and...

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:28.740
Sorry.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.160
I'm in the going-home club.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.460
Bye.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.300
Bye...

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.790
You really want to start a baseball team?

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.310
Yeah!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:46.630
<b>Print</b>

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:46.760
<b>Print</b>

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:47.210
<b>Print</b>

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.180
Well, in that case,

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.310
you need to go through the proper procedures.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.730
"Association Regulations"...

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:59.590
So we can start an association?

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:02.470
If you meet certain conditions.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.900
Association
Regulations

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:03.020
Association
Regulations

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:03.150
Association
Regulations

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:03.270
Association
Regulations

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.640
If it's what you want to do,
you have my support.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.690
Thank you, ma'am!

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:14.650
Hey...

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.340
You're pretty tall.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.830
Wanna join the basketball team?

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.790
Uh, I'm not really into...

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.460
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:26.500
<i>Maybe I'll just join
the going-home club, too.</i>

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.730
I-I-I-I'm sorry!

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:34.550
Careful!

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.810
Are you okay?

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.470
I can see now.

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:41.970
You didn't hurt yourself, did you?

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.160
Uh...

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.270
I-I'm fine.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.380
Aren't you older than me?

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.740
No, I'm a first-year.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:53.070
Are you checking out a club?

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.240
Y-Yeah.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:59.100
I'm looking for the club room, but it 
doesn't seem to be in the club building.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.110
Why don't we look for it together?

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.060
Are you sure?

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:04.420
Sure. Which club is it?

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:06.940
The girls'—

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:10.940
The girls' baseball association
is looking for members!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.730
We're looking for members!

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:12.710
That one!

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:13.380
Huh?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.220
Please consider signing up!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.570
Please consider it!

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:18.390
Baseball?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.080
Yeah!

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:22.230
Huh? Tomocchi...

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.400
You're Nozaki-san from my class, right?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.980
And Ukita-san, too.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.320
You know her?

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.650
She's in my class.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.690
Makes sense.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.890
Have you two picked a club yet?

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:35.190
Oh, um...

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:36.890
Aren't you going to tell them?

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.820
W-Well... I-I...

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:45.170
Hey, would it be possible 
to observe your club?

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.130
Are you interested in baseball?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.140
Huh?

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.960
I-I-I am!

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:56.090
I-If I can't be a player... 
m-maybe, a manager...

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.250
Of course you can be a player!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.560
You're more than welcome!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.050
We're having a trial meet-up tomorrow.

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.460
You should come!

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:06.520
Ah, no... Team sports aren't my...

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.530
Wait!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:11.130
W-Want to go together?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.780
C'mon, girls!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.780
Let's
all
play
baseball
together!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.780
Get your tracksuits on!
We're playing on a dry riverbed,
so it's hardball all the way!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.780
<b>In the event of rain,
it'll be canceled</b>

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.960
It's a perfect day for baseball!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:26.920
And what's more...

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:30.460
Ta-da! Two people showed up.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.630
H-Hello...

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.020
We should all introduce ourselves.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:38.790
I'm Arihara Tsubasa,
and this is my childhood friend...

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.590
Kawakita Tomoe.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.330
I'm Nozaki Yuuki.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.980
I-I'm... Ukita Akane.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.880
I've actually never played 
baseball before.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.310
S-Same here.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.800
That's totally okay!

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.950
I brought gloves and everything!

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.360
There we go.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.000
You brought this many?

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.660
I borrowed them all from a shop I frequent.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:04.170
I don't have any baseball experience, either.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.120
R-Really?

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.550
We're just here to have fun today!

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:10.330
We'll start with stretches.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:16.340
One, two, three, four,

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:20.760
five, six, seven, eight!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.720
Okay, let's play catch!

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:28.660
You hold the ball like this,

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:32.440
with a space the width of a finger 
between your index and middle fingers.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.100
Ah...

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:35.930
And you throw it...

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:39.910
Like that!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.550
Uh...

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:43.790
That wasn't very clear, was it?

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.830
Let's just give it a try!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.700
Okay, here it comes!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.470
Nice catch!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.590
Here I go!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.810
Here it comes, Ukita-san.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.690
I'll throw it slow, okay?

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.520
I-I'm sorry!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:23.150
Don't worry about it!

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:39.340
Are you left-handed, Nozaki-san?

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.280
Huh?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:42.620
Your throw was a little awkward.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.300
Yeah, I am.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.290
Here's a left-handed glove.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.790
They exist?

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:48.520
Yep!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.480
Bring it on!

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.540
Wow...

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:08.530
I'm sorry! I'll go get the ball!

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:10.660
Nah, it's no problem!

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.330
Let's take a little break.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.630
Yeah.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:24.070
What? He's not coming?

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.090
What should we do?

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.010
Ukita-san?

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.570
I've got some honey and lemon juice.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.540
Want some?

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:38.020
Thanks.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.530
So sweet!

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:49.370
I put too much sugar in.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.700
I think...

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:55.390
I'm afraid I'll get hurt by the ball.

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:58.670
But you're interested in baseball, right?

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:04.630
Back in grade school, a friend who
was really nice to me played baseball.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.020
I thought baseball was
the coolest thing ever,

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:13.090
so when I heard there was a girls' team, 
I thought maybe I could play, too...

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.830
But I'm just not cut out for sports.

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.160
You're really good, Nozaki-san.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:24.800
Huh? No, I'm terrible...

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:27.120
But you caught the ball

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.470
and threw it really far.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.910
It looked like you used to play a sport...

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.280
In grade school, I played dodgeball.

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:38.940
And in middle school,
I played basketball for a bit.

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:40.990
But...

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.300
I...

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.150
Yuuki, shoot!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.320
Keep going, Yuuki! We can still win this!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.490
<i>Wait...</i>

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:10.370
<i>I'm... still...</i>

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:20.520
I always held my teammates back in games.

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:25.410
So I'm a little scared of
picking up another team sport.

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:27.170
I see...

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:35.100
Hey... Let's just...

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.350
Nozaki-san! Ukita-san!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.980
Wanna play a match?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:43.570
Huh?

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.860
We're playing Triangles?

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:50.940
Yeah.

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:52.410
What's that?

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.370
It's sorta like a simplified 
version of baseball.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.220
Those kids came down here
to play baseball too,

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:00.120
but they're short on players.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:03.790
And we thought, if we're going to play 'em,
we should treat it like a real game!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.710
How about it? Wanna play with us?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.300
Well, if you need the extra players.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.580
What about you, Ukita-san?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.090
I'll just watch...

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.390
Okay!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.090
We're ready.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.140
Who's gonna umpire?

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.980
If it's six on six,
we'll have an extra person.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.090
I'll do it.

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:24.310
Would you, please?

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.260
Let's pick the teams.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.800
All right!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.530
<b>Nozaki Team</b>

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.530
<b>Arihara Team</b>

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.720
Let's do this, team!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:36.990
Yeah!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.360
We're gonna win!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.620
Yeah!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.710
Yeah...

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.550
<i>A metal bat...</i>

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:53.760
<i>I bet that'd hurt...</i>

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.040
You can do it!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.920
Home run! Home run!

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:59.720
That's impossible!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.190
Strike!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.400
Strike!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.130
Strike! Batter out!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.990
How was that a strike?

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.080
It was above shoulder height! Clearly a ball!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.660
What? I don't know what you're talking about.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.230
You're a lousy umpire!

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:23.790
Yellow card!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.470
This isn't soccer!

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:27.790
At least take a swing.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.260
Sorry...

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.020
Are you okay?

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:35.830
I guess I'm not cut out 
for baseball, either.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.030
Is this your first time playing?

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.060
Huh?

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.800
Try choking up on the bat.

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:45.810
And take a wider stance.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.190
And you should also...

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:50.280
C-Can you go over that again, please?

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.630
You hold the bat like this...

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.340
Like this?

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:10.630
<b>Nozaki Team      0
Arihara Team</b>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:20.600
<b>Nozaki Team      0
Arihara Team     1</b>

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:25.750
Onee-chan!

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.360
Swing the bat this time!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.040
Home run! Home run!

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:47.870
I... hit it?

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.330
Onee-chan!

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.690
Go!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.020
Run!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.590
Go, Onee-chan!

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:08.660
<i>I think I like this...</i>

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.070
Safe!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:28.870
Out!

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:32.100
Nozaki-san...

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:38.730
It's fun.

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:44.470
Why don't you play with us?

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.850
Maybe just a little...

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.310
Hey, no fair!
You can't bring in another player!

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:57.160
What's the problem?

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:00.180
We're losing, so let us have this one.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:03.570
It's okay!

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.870
What?!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.800
Why?!

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:07.320
That's not right!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:13.480
Is she calling a home run?

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.090
I won't let her get one!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:30.710
I'm scared...

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:32.690
Ukita-san!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.860
Go after it!

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:36.130
You can do it!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.750
Run!

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:39.940
Go!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.160
Go, go, go!

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.870
Hurry!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.290
Over here!

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:12.750
Out!

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.310
No way!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.740
Nice play!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.650
Let's play again sometime!

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:33.650
Bye!

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:34.570
Thanks!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:36.060
Don't forget!

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:37.990
We're heading this way. You?

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:40.340
We're going this way.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.550
Then...

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.300
See you later!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.760
Yes, see you at school.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.900
Do you think they had fun?

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.860
It sure looked like it.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:03.360
I hope so.

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:05.530
What did you think?

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:09.110
It didn't feel much like a trial meet-up...

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:11.980
You're right.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:16.090
But... it was fun... I think.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:20.290
I think I had fun, too.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.380
Nozaki-san, what are you going to do?

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.840
What about you?

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:27.180
I...

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:30.390
Want to try it together?

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:39.270
Okay.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:49.800
Did you find Arihara-san and Kawakita-san?

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.540
No, I can't find them.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.360
Where could they be?

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.150
What do you mean?!

00:21:59.210 --> 00:21:59.580
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:21:59.580 --> 00:21:59.710
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:00.710
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:02.380
Tsubasa...

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:05.920
Why can't we practice here at school?!

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.130
Huh?

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>Can or Can't</b>
